			"notes": "- Fixed MineSkin API to use the V2 API.\n\n## Notes for samo_lego or anybody else wishing to update Fabric Tailor\n- V2's result format has been changed. You may wish to use the `queue` endpoint rather than the `generate` endpoint, which will let you periodically check for the skin instead of holding up the server thread until the skin has been applied.\n  - This uses `generate` as a quick and easy fix.\n- The link params for generate have been moved to the POST request body. `model` has been changed to `variant` and should use `classic` instead of `steve`. `slim` remains the same.\n- `generate` is now a singular endpoint, whether generate is a URL or a file depends on what is in the POST request's body.\n  - URL uploads use `application/json`, simply because I couldn't really be bothered to learn the more heavyweight `multipart/form-data` for a quick fix."
		}
